.SH "نام (NAME)"
hugin_stitch_project \- Stitch a hugin project
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBhugin_stitch_project\fR [options] [\fI<project\fR> \fI<images\fR> ...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
A GUI tool to stitch a single hugin project.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fB\-h|\-\-help\fR 4
.IX Item "-h|--help"
Show help message
.IP \fB\-o|\-\-output\fR=<str> 4
.IX Item "-o|--output=<str>"
Output prefix
.IP \fB\-t|\-\-threads\fR=<num> 4
.IX Item "-t|--threads=<num>"
Number of threads
.IP \fB\-d|\-\-delete\fR 4
.IX Item "-d|--delete"
Delete .pto file after stitching
